  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "B案、C案都不錯，\n但我們還是選A案吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042684830010043684890FD4E0D932FFF0C000A4F46621150119084662F9078004168485427FF1F00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比起少了點震撼力的A案或C案，\n我的B案好像比較好？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD48D775C114E869EDE970764BC529B768400416848621600436848FF0C000A6211768400426848597D50CF6BD48F03597DFF1F00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我覺得我的C案才是最棒的。\n我們真是互不相讓呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189BA5F976211768400436848624D662F670068D276843002000A62115011771F662F4E924E0D76F88B935462300200100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？我們問一問\n那邊那位年輕人的意見吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F62115011554F4E00554F000A90A3908A90A34F4D5E748F154EBA7684610F898B5427300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好辦法！只有我們3個人的話，\n大概永遠只會在這裡兜圈子了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D8FA66CD5FF0153EA6709621150110033500B4EBA76848A71FF0C000A592769826C38906053EA67035728901988E1515C57085B504E86300200100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哈囉哈囉，這位年輕人，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以幫幫我們嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C856C954C856C9FF0C90194F4D5E748F154EBAFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE55E6B5E6B6211501155CEFF1F00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這條街道很不錯，\n但就是沒什麼亮點……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019689D885790535F884E0D932FFF0C000A4F465C31662F6C924EC09EBC4EAE9EDE2026202600100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是，我們想幫它取個名字吸引大家，\n好讓這裡能熱鬧起來。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662FFF0C6211501160F35E6B5B8353D6500B540D5B5754385F1559275BB6FF0C000A597D8B93901988E180FD71B19B278D774F86300200100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，請讓我們聽聽<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的意見吧。\n畢竟年輕人才是城市未來的主人翁。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C8ACB8B9362115011807D807D00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684610F898B54273002000A75627ADF5E748F154EBA624D662F57CE5E02672A4F8676844E3B4EBA7FC1300200100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，我們正在考慮的街名\n大概就是這些。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C621150116B6357288003616E76848857540D000A592769825C31662F90194E9B300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A案「<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大密阿雷大街<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>」。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n取個誇大一點的名字，\n我猜能讓大家對這裡有所期待。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00416848300C00100002FF00000659275BC6963F96F75927885700100002FF000000300D300200100001BE01000A53D6500B8A8759274E009EDE7684540D5B57FF0C000A6211731C80FD8B9359275BB65C0D901988E167096240671F5F85300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "B案「<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>超級進化路<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>」。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這是我的提案。\n當然，這和實際的超級進化沒有關係。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00426848300C00100002FF0000068D857D1A903253168DEF00100002FF000000300D300200100001BE01000A9019662F6211768463D068483002000A75767136FF0C9019548C5BE6969B76848D857D1A903253166C92670995DC4FC2300200100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C案是「<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>頭頭市道<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>」。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n顧名思義，就是來自頭頭是道。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
